ou want to stay focused rather than becoming emotional. It is helpful to briefly present the facts of the situation and express your ideas in an organized way. You may include a few brief explanations for some of your points.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Introduce the Situation \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Words to Order Your Points and Explanations\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I want to tell you   about ...<br></br>  This is based on ...</br></br>  It's a method that ... </br></br>  The situation is that ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">First of all,  </span> (or)<span class=\\\"italic\\\">   Firstly,  </br> Secondly, </span> <ul><li>(Explanation: <span class=\\\"italic\\\">After all </span>... )</ul> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Third, </span> <ul><li>(Explanation: <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Of course </span>...)</ul> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Next, <br>Finally,  </span>     (or)   <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Lastly,</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "First of all, it's honest. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Secondly, it appeals to everyone's better side. We're talking about a sensitive matter, of course. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Third, it is going to create some real change. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "After all, that is important to me, the public, and the community. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Finally, it will be good for business.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use at work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sensitive matter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a subject that raises strong or quick emotions", "type": "definition"}, {"content