": "34500", "image": "engenn8le09ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Rocco is a wise mentor.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Now, Miranda. Our staff will need to be prepared. Polygon will go through a challenging time for awhile. You will have to prepare a staff meeting around crisis management.", "id": 3, "time": "68400", "image": "engenn8le09ob01re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le09ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le09ob01re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}